    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take down The Cube one block at a time and collect resources to improve your mining speed, health, and damage.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/extras/4f4752b3e597df2faf756e92800fcd6d.poster.avif?t=1750373426\" width=610 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/extras/4f4752b3e597df2faf756e92800fcd6d.webm?t=1750373426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/extras/4f4752b3e597df2faf756e92800fcd6d.mp4?t=1750373426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your experience to buy special items to increase your mining efficiency such as corrosive mites, giant worms, and mining lasers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/extras/8b47b363538acd3f42fa1fffa4400aa4.poster.avif?t=1750373426\" width=610 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/extras/8b47b363538acd3f42fa1fffa4400aa4.webm?t=1750373426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/extras/8b47b363538acd3f42fa1fffa4400aa4.mp4?t=1750373426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Idle mode allows you to mine casually while performing other tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/extras/35cd225a87ecac72d6ac44d9b0c2a148.poster.avif?t=1750373426\" width=610 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/extras/35cd225a87ecac72d6ac44d9b0c2a148.webm?t=1750373426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/extras/35cd225a87ecac72d6ac44d9b0c2a148.mp4?t=1750373426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the Boss Cubes in order to become the mining master!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take down The Cube one block at a time and collect resources to improve your mining speed, health, and damage.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/extras/4f4752b3e597df2faf756e92800fcd6d.poster.avif?t=1750373426\" width=610 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/extras/4f4752b3e597df2faf756e92800fcd6d.webm?t=1750373426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/extras/4f4752b3e597df2faf756e92800fcd6d.mp4?t=1750373426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your experience to buy special items to increase your mining efficiency such as corrosive mites, giant worms, and mining lasers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/extras/8b47b363538acd3f42fa1fffa4400aa4.poster.avif?t=1750373426\" width=610 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/extras/8b47b363538acd3f42fa1fffa4400aa4.webm?t=1750373426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/extras/8b47b363538acd3f42fa1fffa4400aa4.mp4?t=1750373426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Idle mode allows you to mine casually while performing other tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/extras/35cd225a87ecac72d6ac44d9b0c2a148.poster.avif?t=1750373426\" width=610 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/extras/35cd225a87ecac72d6ac44d9b0c2a148.webm?t=1750373426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/extras/35cd225a87ecac72d6ac44d9b0c2a148.mp4?t=1750373426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the Boss Cubes in order to become the mining master!</p>",
